IShoppingMallShipment.IRequest.description:
Search criteria and pagination parameters for filtering shipments.

This request body allows sellers to search and filter their shipment history with various criteria. You can filter shipments by delivery status (pending, delivered, or confirmed), track by carrier name or tracking number, and search within specific date ranges for shipping and delivery dates.

All filter fields are optional, allowing you to retrieve all shipments or narrow down results based on your needs. The pagination parameters (page and limit) help manage large result sets efficiently.

Example usage:
- Find all pending shipments: { status: "pending" }
- Search by tracking number: { tracking_number: "1Z999" }
- Get shipments from last month: { shipped_at_from: "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z", shipped_at_to: "2024-01-31T23:59:59Z" }
- Paginate results: { page: 2, limit: 50 }

