   * 4. If a pending request exists, throw a validation error (only one pending request allowed per admin)
   * 5. Create new record with:
   *    - id: Generate UUID
   *    - shopping_mall_admin_id: From authenticated session
   *    - reason: From request body (trimmed)
   *    - status: 'pending' (system-set)
   *    - submitted_at: Current timestamp
   *    - responded_at: NULL
   *    - created_at: Current timestamp
   *    - updated_at: Current timestamp
   *    - deleted_at: NULL
